<section class="case-section">
  <div class="case-section__head"><span class="mono" data-reveal>How it went</span><h2 class="display-s" data-split>The numbers tell part of the story.</h2></div>
  <div class="case-section__body prose" data-reveal>
    <p>Those numbers came from an economy built to reward play, not spend — and from a daily loop and a ladder that finally pointed the same way. In 2023 Skyweaver was nominated for Best Mobile Game, Best Card Game and Best Strategy Game at the GAM3 Awards.</p>
    <p>The part I am proudest of is quieter. Over four years I watched seven junior designers become better designers. I learned to give away work I could have kept, and to give feedback that makes someone sharper instead of smaller.</p>
  </div>
</section>

